{
  "id": "u14-l06",
  "unit": "u14-feelings-health",
  "title": "At the pharmacy",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**ফার্মেসি** is the usual word in Bangladesh; **ওষুধের দোকান** 'medicine shop' works everywhere. **-এর** means 'of': **জ্বরের ওষুধ** 'medicine for a fever'.\n\nAsk: **জ্বরের ওষুধ আছে?** 'Do you have anything for a fever?' and **এই ওষুধ কত?** The pharmacist may warn you: **খালি পেটে খাবেন না** 'Don't take it on an empty stomach' (polite 'don't' = future + **না**, U13).\n\nWith তুই, **নাও → নে**: **এই নে** 'here, take it'. And a favour from your brother: **তুই কি আমার জন্য ওষুধ কিনতে পারবি?**",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "farmeshi",
      "bn": "ফার্মেসি",
      "tr": "farmeshi",
      "en": "pharmacy",
      "notes": "Common in Bangladesh. Also ওষুধের দোকান 'medicine shop', usual in Kolkata."
    },
    {
      "id": "oshudher",
      "bn": "ওষুধের",
      "tr": "oshudher",
      "en": "medicine's; of medicine",
      "notes": "ওষুধ + -এর: ওষুধের দোকান 'medicine shop'."
    },
    {
      "id": "jorer",
      "bn": "জ্বরের",
      "tr": "jorer",
      "en": "fever's; for fever",
      "notes": "জ্বর + -এর: জ্বরের ওষুধ 'medicine for a fever'."
    },
    {
      "id": "khali",
      "bn": "খালি",
      "tr": "khali",
      "en": "empty; free",
      "notes": "খালি পেটে 'on an empty stomach'. Also 'only': খালি পানি 'just water'."
    },
    {
      "id": "pete",
      "bn": "পেটে",
      "tr": "pete",
      "en": "in the stomach",
      "notes": "পেট + -এ: খালি পেটে 'on an empty stomach'."
    },
    {
      "id": "ne",
      "bn": "নে",
      "tr": "ne",
      "en": "take (intimate)",
      "notes": "তুই command: নাও → নে. এই নে 'here, take it'."
    }
  ],
